<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=Cp1252">
    <meta name="generator" content="Helen">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../../../../javahelp.css">
    <title>Closing a network</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img border="0" hspace="0" height="32" width="32" src=
      "../../../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c3_32.gif">&nbsp; Closing a network
    </h1>
    <p>
       &nbsp;
    </p>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="4" style=
    " page-break-inside: auto; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto;" cellspacing="0"
    bordercolor="#000000" width="488">
      <col width="232">
      <col width="239"><THEAD>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="479">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Use case: Closing a network</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="479">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Comment:</font></b> <font size="3">This use case is executed when
            the user wants to close a window of the multi-document environment.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="479">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Actor: User</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      </THEAD><TBODY>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Normal course</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="239">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Alternative courses</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.The user indicates to the program that he/she wants to close the
            actual window of the multi-document environment.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="239">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.If the network has been modified but not saved, the program asks the
            user whether to save the network, don't save or cancel.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="239">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.1.If the network has not been changed or if it is been saved and it
            has not been modified after it, it goes to point 4.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td rowspan="2" width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.If the user does not want to save the network, it goes to point
            4.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="239">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.1.If the user wants to save the network, it goes to use case
            <i>Saving a network.</i></font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="239">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.2.If the user decides not to close the window, the use case
            ends.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3">4.The window is closed.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="239">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">5.The item associated to the window closed is removed from the window
            list of the menu under the multi-document environment.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="239">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">6.The previous window of the window list is selected and it goes to the
            use case <i>Selecting a network.</i></font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="239">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">6.1.If there are no other nets in the multi-document environment, all
            menu options under the multi-document environment are disabled and also all the main
            menu options and toolbars except the options for creating a new network, openning a
            network and displaying the window messages.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      </TBODY>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
